# Ship only the bundled extension, its icon and the docs.
# Everything else (src, webview sources, tests, fixtures, node_modules,
# configs, source maps) stays out of the .vsix.
**
!dist/**
!media/icon.png
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!package.json
**/*.map
**/.DS_Store
